# Private cloud repository boundary.
#
# The Git repository intentionally lives at this workspace root so the
# authoritative AGENTS.md and V1.0 product baseline travel with cloud_oam.
# Everything else (work/, outputs/, sessions, operational scripts, and local
# evidence) is denied by default and must never be added implicitly.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/AGENTS.md
!/docs/
!/cloud_oam/

# Only the frozen product baseline is allowed from the workspace docs folder.
/docs/*
!/docs/RSC个人仓与物资运营扩展系统_正式生产版需求与架构设计_V1.0.md
